# API Backend Rules

- One file = one route: `api/foo.ts` → `/api/foo`
- Use `.js` extensions on all local imports (ESM on Vercel)
- Every protected route: `requireAuth()` → `checkUsageLimit()` → AI call → `logApiUsage()` + `incrementUsage()`
- AI-heavy routes: add `checkRateLimit()` from `./lib/rate-limit.js`
- CORS headers on all routes (match existing pattern)
- Set function timeout in `vercel.json` if route exceeds 30s default
- Never expose `SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY`, `GROK_API_KEY`, etc. to frontend
- Supabase admin client: `api/lib/supabase-admin.ts` only
- Prompt/preset data lives in `api/data/` and `api/lib/guiones/script-prompts/`
